              {"block_id": "G26d77Block02", "kind": "paragraph", "markdown": "记录字段按用途收窄为原话、发生语境、可问的问题和未出现的承诺。林舟没有补写这位客户的行业、联系人或可能金额，因为这些信息对判断是否值得问一次使用场景没有作用。原话保留短句，避免后来把礼貌回应改写成更强的意向。", "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d77Block02Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-17T11:31:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D77"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C04", "C06"]}}},
              {"block_id": "G26d77Block11", "kind": "paragraph", "markdown": "原留言的日期和保存位置也单独记在卡片底部，方便以后确认自己引用的是哪一次回应；该位置不是客户材料入口，也不授权林舟读取旧咨询的其他内容。卡片只需要能够回到这条短留言，不需要把旧项目重新打开。", "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d77Block11Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-17T11:43:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D77"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C04", "C06"]}}},
              {"block_id": "G26d77Block05", "kind": "paragraph", "markdown": "反证栏记录本次没有获得的三类信息：没有转介绍对象，没有购买或试用请求，也没有愿意提供材料的表示。它不是要证明对方拒绝了什么，只是提醒读者不要从一条正面评价推出销售阶段。卡片状态因此是“访谈线索”，不是“待跟进商机”。", "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d77Block05Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-17T12:16:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D77"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C04", "C06"]}}},
              {"block_id": "G26d77Block08", "kind": "paragraph", "markdown": "线索卡另有“联系前检查”小栏：访谈目的是否能用一句话说明、问题是否只围绕旧留言的场景、以及若对方不愿继续是否不再追问。三项任何一项没有准备好，林舟就不发送问候。这个栏记录的是发信前的自检，不是客户已经同意接受访谈。", "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d77Block08Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-17T12:39:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D77"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C04", "C06"]}}},
              {"block_id": "G26d77Block10", "kind": "paragraph", "markdown": "提问稿旁还写明发送后只等一次选择：愿意聊、暂时不便或没有回复。林舟不会把任何一种结果自动同步给销售表；只有对方明确愿意讨论时，才有新的访谈记录。这样“联系”本身也不会被记成取得了商业进展。", "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d77Block10Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-17T12:46:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D77"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C04", "C06"]}}},
              {"block_id": "G26d77Block03", "kind": "paragraph", "markdown": "未发送的提问稿从对方实际说过的话出发：他当时是在回查哪一种变化，以及哪一步最容易失去原处。发出前还要先说明这是一次访谈，不是产品邀约；今天没有预约、没有转介请求，也没有把他和竹影当前试点放进同一条记录。", "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d77Block03Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-17T12:03:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D77"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C04", "C06"]}}},
              {"block_id": "G26d77Block09", "kind": "paragraph", "markdown": "若未来只有一句“最近忙”，卡片也只在日期下记为未安排，不把沉默换算成兴趣下降或机会关闭。这样林舟以后回看时能分清：今天有一条有用的反馈，之后是否继续聊天仍是另一件没有发生的事。", "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d77Block09Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-17T12:52:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "ambiguous", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D77"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C04", "C06"]}}},
              {"block_id": "G26d77Block07", "kind": "paragraph", "markdown": "如果对方日后愿意谈，新页面才登记日期、他同意讨论的场景和实际回答；本页继续保存今天这条留言。若没有新回复，下一步只是让林舟决定要不要写一封清楚说明目的的问候，不产生任何销售结论。", "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d77Block07Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-17T12:45:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D77"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C04", "C06"]}}}
            ],
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d77InquiryNoteAuth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-17T11:14:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D77"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C04", "C06"]}}
          }
        ],
        "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d77DocSourceAuth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-17T11:14:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D77"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C04", "C06"]}}
      }
    ],
    "im": [
      {
        "source_id": "G26d78ImSource",
        "schema": "pneuma.source.im/v1",
        "provider": "mock",
        "archive_id": "G26d78StateArchive",
        "owner_user_ids": ["G26userLin"],
        "users": [
          {"user_id": "G26userLin", "display_name": "林舟", "role": "product", "synthetic_address": "lin.zhou@seamlog.test", "is_bot": false},
          {"user_id": "G26userChen", "display_name": "陈放", "role": "operations", "synthetic_address": "chen.fang@bamboo.test", "is_bot": false},
          {"user_id": "G26userWu", "display_name": "吴岚", "role": "manager", "synthetic_address": "lan.wu@bamboo.test", "is_bot": false}
        ],
        "conversations": [
          {
            "conversation_id": "G26d78StateConversation",
            "conversation_type": "group_dm",
            "title": "材料替代链的最后状态",
            "member_ids": ["G26userLin", "G26userChen", "G26userWu"],
            "messages": [
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg01", "sender_id": "G26userLin", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T09:18:00+08:00", "full_text": "我晨跑回来把小腿拉了一下，下午可能走得慢些。陈放，昨天那条材料替代记录还差的不是链接修正，而是现场对状态的最后一句确认；我不想自己替它选“已确认”。", "thread_id": null, "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg01Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T09:18:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "ambiguous", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg02", "sender_id": "G26userChen", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T09:31:00+08:00", "full_text": "刚拿到现场的回复：那段被替代的材料确实按这次记录里的范围处理，留下“待确认”的人也可以把状态改成已确认。回复只说明这一段和这次状态，不替第一条预算记录补任何新内容。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg01", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg02Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T09:31:00+08:00", "author_role": "operations", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg03", "sender_id": "G26userLin", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T09:39:00+08:00", "full_text": "那我会把这句确认作为今天新增的状态依据，仍保留昨天选定的材料片段和它原来的来源位置。材料、导入动作、现场确认和状态留存人分开显示；这样以后回看时，不会把今天的答复倒写成材料一开始就带着的结论。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg01", "edited_at": "2026-05-18T09:44:00+08:00", "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg03Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T09:44:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg04", "sender_id": "G26userWu", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T09:52:00+08:00", "full_text": "我看的是这次状态终于能回到材料和确认，不是听说“两条都好了”就结束。第一条预算链之前已能回源，第二条现在也有它自己的来源和确认；两条的状态不要合成一个总的通过标记。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg01", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg04Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T09:52:00+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg05", "sender_id": "G26userChen", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T10:04:00+08:00", "full_text": "对。第二条的跳转修正如果以后还有变化，仍单列成定位观察；它已经不该占用状态栏。今天得到的是状态确认，不是把每个阅读问题也宣布消失。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg03", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg05Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T10:04:00+08:00", "author_role": "operations", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg06", "sender_id": "G26userLin", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T10:13:00+08:00", "full_text": "我会在两个链旁各留四样东西：原材料入口、谁在何时留下状态、这次确认对应哪段材料、以及仍另行追踪的定位问题。预算链不会因为材料替代链确认就被重新写一遍；材料替代链也不会借预算邮件补它自己的来处。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg03", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg06Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T10:13:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg07", "sender_id": "G26userWu", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T10:26:00+08:00", "full_text": "阶段复盘可以约，但先别把它叫成续用讨论。我只想看两条记录各自能不能说明来源和状态；删除演练的业务确认还在另一张清单里，我没有在那件事上给出回复。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg04", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg07Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T10:26:00+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "ambiguous", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C03", "C04", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg08", "sender_id": "G26userChen", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T10:41:00+08:00", "full_text": "我会把现场那句答复的位置附在第二条状态旁，也把它限定成这次材料范围。以后若材料换了，仍得重新问，不能拿今天的确认替下一次变更预先盖章。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg02", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg08Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T10:41:00+08:00", "author_role": "operations", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg09", "sender_id": "G26userLin", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T10:55:00+08:00", "full_text": "我下午少坐一会儿，先把两条链的状态出处整理好，再发一个只写复盘目的的时间选择。附录、尾款和任何延长说法都不放进这次邀请；它们没有因为今天的确认变成已解决。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg07", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg09Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T10:55:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C03", "C04", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg10", "sender_id": "G26userWu", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T11:09:00+08:00", "full_text": "林舟先把腿歇一歇。我去楼下买个热饭团，保温袋里那盒午饭放得太久；回来顺手把窗边的水杯洗掉。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg09", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg10Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T11:09:00+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}}
            ],
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78StateConversationAuth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T09:18:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C03", "C04", "C05", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "conversation_id": "G26d78ReviewCardConversation",
            "conversation_type": "dm",
            "title": "午后复盘卡片",
            "member_ids": ["G26userLin", "G26userWu"],
            "messages": [
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg11", "sender_id": "G26userLin", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T13:36:00+08:00", "full_text": "我把复盘卡片改成两行，不再写总评：预算调整行指回原有邮件和现场会；材料替代行指回今天的材料范围和现场答复。每行只留一个“读不明白时回到哪里”的位置。", "thread_id": null, "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg11Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T13:36:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg12", "sender_id": "G26userWu", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T13:49:00+08:00", "full_text": "这样我读起来会快一些。材料替代那行把今天答复的说话人和时间放在同一格；预算那行不要为了对称去补一条新的确认。两行可以并排，但各自的问题仍各自回去找。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg11", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg12Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T13:49:00+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg13", "sender_id": "G26userLin", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T14:02:00+08:00", "full_text": "我不确定卡片左边该写“状态依据”还是“本次确认”。先空着标题，等你看完两行再说；标题不该替记录本身下结论。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg11", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg13Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T14:02:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "ambiguous", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg14", "sender_id": "G26userWu", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T14:18:00+08:00", "full_text": "先留空。我在路上，晚些只会在看不懂的那一行做标记，不需要你现在把卡片排得像对外文件。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg13", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg14Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T14:18:00+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "ambiguous", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg15", "sender_id": "G26userLin", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T14:31:00+08:00", "full_text": "冰袋外面全是水，我找了条旧毛巾垫在椅子上。电脑先合上十分钟，卡片还停在两行，没有趁休息再加别的栏目。", "thread_id": null, "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg15Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T14:31:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg16", "sender_id": "G26userWu", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T15:04:00+08:00", "full_text": "我只标了材料替代那行的一个词：把“现场”换成能回到今天答复的位置。除此之外，两行的读法已经够清楚；删除那张确认栏我还没看。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg11", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg16Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T15:04:00+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C03", "C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg17", "sender_id": "G26userLin", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T15:17:00+08:00", "full_text": "已改成答复位置，也没有动预算那行。复盘卡片现在只供我们下次读记录时用；我还没决定要不要约具体时间，等你空下来再说。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg16", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg17Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T15:17:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "ambiguous", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "G26d78Msg18", "sender_id": "G26userWu", "sent_at": "2026-05-18T15:29:00+08:00", "full_text": "可以，先停在这里。下次读卡时若两行都能找到各自的出处，就继续沿着记录看；若有一行读不通，再把具体位置带回来问。", "thread_id": "G26d78Msg17", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78Msg18Auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T15:29:00+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}}
            ],
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78ReviewCardConversationAuth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T13:36:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C03", "C05", "C06"]}}
          }
        ],
        "authorship": {"authored_id": "G26d78ImSourceAuth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-18T09:18:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D78"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C03", "C04", "C05", "C06"]}}
      }
